==Battleground==
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Ashura (Enemy)|Ashura]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

